<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Self-Directed Search System Password Reset Code</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #ffffff; color: #111827; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; }
    .email { max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 28px; }
    .topbar { height: 5px; margin-bottom: 26px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #2d8bc4 0 42%, #ffeb3b 42% 50%, #f44336 50% 58%, #ffeb3b 58% 66%, #2d8bc4 66% 100%); }
    .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #2d8bc4; }
    h1 { margin: 0 0 22px; padding-bottom: 18px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.25; color: #07183d; }
    p { margin: 0 0 16px; }
    .code-label { margin: 22px 0 6px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #4b5563; }
    .code { display: block; margin: 0 0 8px; font-family: "Courier New", monospace; font-size: 36px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 8px; color: #07183d; }
    .note { font-size: 13px; color: #4b5563; }
    .security { margin-top: 24px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; font-size: 13px; color: #374151; }
    .footer { margin-top: 30px; padding-top: 18px; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="email">
    <div class="topbar"></div>
    <p class="eyebrow">Account recovery</p>
    <h1>Self-Directed Search System</h1>

    <p>Hello {{firstName}},</p>
    <p>We received a request to reset the password for your Self-Directed Search System account. Use the code below to continue.</p>

    <p class="code-label">Password reset code</p>
    <span class="code">{{verificationCode}}</span>
    <p class="note">This code expires in {{otpExpiresMinutes}} minutes.</p>

    <div class="security">
      If you did not request a password reset, ignore this email. Your account password will not change unless this code is entered in the system.
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <strong>Self-Directed Search System</strong><br>
      Ministry of Labour and Social Security - Kingdom of Eswatini<br>
      Powered by Datamatics Eswatini
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
